## Infrastructure

**TenantContext**: ThreadLocal storing `tenantId`, `tenantDbName` + MDC  
**TenantFilter**: Validate tenant exists & active, set context in try-finally  
**MultiTenantConnectionProvider**: HikariCP cache with LRU eviction

